/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"Fastlane:"},"171":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-93","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"valida las herramientas locales y el clúster seleccionado"},"172":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-94","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala o actualiza Envoy Gateway 1.8 y crea la `GatewayClass` `eg`"},"173":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-95","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"crea el namespace"},"174":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-96","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala PostgreSQL y crea las bases de datos necesarias"},"175":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-97","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala Keycloak y crea el realm `lamassu`, el cliente frontend, el rol administrador y el usuario inicial"},"176":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-98","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala RabbitMQ"},"177":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-99","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala opcionalmente observabilidad y componentes HSM de laboratorio"},"178":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-100","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"genera `lamassu.yaml` e instala el chart de Lamassu"},"179":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"carga datos de ejemplo opcionalmente"},"180":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"La configuración generada expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del mismo Gateway y provisiona al usuario inicial `lamassu` como superadministrador de Lamassu."},"181":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Al proporcionar `--tls-crt` y `--tls-key`, Fastlane crea el Secret `downstream-provided-crt` y configura `tls.type: external`."},"182":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Sin ellos, configura cert-manager con un emisor self-signed. Es adecuado para laboratorio, pero los clientes no confiarán en él hasta que distribuyas la CA. Usa Helm si necesitas un Issuer corporativo, un emisor ACME público o un Secret existente gestionado por otro sistema."},"183":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El modo no interactivo genera contraseñas aleatorias para los administradores de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak. El acceso inicial a Lamassu es `lamassu` / `lamassu` y obliga a cambiar la contraseña en el primer uso."},"184":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-106","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Fastlane escribe `lamassu.yaml` en el directorio actual e incluye credenciales en él."},"185":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-107","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Protege el archivo de valores generado, guarda las credenciales en un almacén de secretos apropiado y no reutilices la configuración de identidad de evaluación en producción."},"186":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-108","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#verifica-la-instalación","content":"Abre `https://pki.example.com` e inicia sesión con el usuario inicial. Si el Gateway está programado pero la URL no es accesible, sigue las comprobaciones de Expón el Gateway."},"187":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"page","content":"Instala con Helm","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes self-managed"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm"},"188":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-0","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","content":"Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes."},"189":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-1","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Instala Lamassu con Helm"},"190":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-2","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Antes de comenzar"},"191":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-3","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"1\\. Instala los requisitos del Gateway"},"192":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-4","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"2\\. Crea un archivo de valores"},"193":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-5","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"TLS con un Secret existente"},"194":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-6","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Provisiona el primer administrador"},"195":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-7","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"3\\. Instala Lamassu"},"196":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-8","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"4\\. Verifica el despliegue"},"197":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-9","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Decisiones para producción"},"198":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-10","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Usa Helm cuando necesites control explícito sobre identidad, bases de datos, mensajería, certificados, almacenamiento y upgrades. Para un entorno de evaluación en el que el script pueda tomar esas decisiones, usa Fastlane."},"199":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-11","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Prepara los servicios de plataforma que quedan deliberadamente fuera del chart de Lamassu:"},"200":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-12","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un clúster Kubernetes 1.24+ y Helm 3.2+"},"201":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-13","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un servidor PostgreSQL accesible y un rol autorizado para crear bases de datos y schemas"},"202":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-14","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"203":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"204":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"205":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"206":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"207":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"208":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"209":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"210":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"211":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"212":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu. El chart actual renderiza sus recursos de issuer self-signed y certificado CA incluso cuando `tls.type: external` hace que el Gateway use un Secret TLS existente. Seleccionar TLS externo no elimina por tanto el requisito de cert-manager."},"213":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"214":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"