rview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"PersistentVolumeClaims necesarios para el almacenamiento local predeterminado de KMS y VA"},"347":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Una StorageClass, almacenamiento físico, backups y un backend compartido/externo cuando el escalado lo requiera"},"348":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Integraciones opcionales"},"349":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-43","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Puntos de configuración para observabilidad, conectores AWS y conectividad PKCS#11/HSM"},"350":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-44","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Los backends de observabilidad, credenciales cloud y un HSM de producción o servicio externo de claves"},"351":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-45","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart crea el `Gateway` y las rutas de Lamassu. No instala el controlador Envoy Gateway ni hace que el Service `LoadBalancer` generado sea accesible desde tu red."},"352":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-46","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu en los puertos 80 y 443 y deja que sus HTTPRoutes distribuyan el tráfico a todos los servicios. Proporciona a ese Gateway un único endpoint accesible mediante el balanceador del clúster, o reenvía tráfico desde un proxy externo o un dispositivo NAT. No necesitas un Gateway por servicio."},"353":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-47","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El chart crea un `Gateway` compartido por cada release de Helm. Todos los recursos `HTTPRoute` gestionados por el chart se conectan a él. Envoy Gateway provisiona el data plane del proxy y un Service `LoadBalancer` de Kubernetes para ese Gateway."},"354":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El valor `gateway.addresses` solo solicita una dirección al controlador del Gateway. No hace que una IP sea enrutable, abre un firewall, configura DNS ni crea NAT. Consulta Expón el Gateway antes de definirlo."},"355":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Kubernetes 1.24 o posterior"},"356":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Helm 3.2 o posterior"},"357":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8 o posterior y una `GatewayClass`"},"358":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"cert-manager 1.14 o posterior; el chart actual renderiza recursos issuer y certificate de cert-manager"},"359":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"almacenamiento persistente adecuado para la configuración elegida de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, VA y KMS"},"360":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"una implementación de balanceador o alguna otra ruta deliberada desde los clientes hasta el Gateway"},"361":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Los despliegues KMS que usan el sidecar PKCS#11 nativo requieren Kubernetes 1.29 o posterior."},"362":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-56","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Instala con Helm\" description=\"Prepara dependencias, configura valores, instala y verifica un despliegue controlado.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/helm\" />"},"363":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Expón el Gateway\" description=\"Elige un diseño de tráfico externo, comprende gateway.addresses y gestiona varios Gateways.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/networking\" />"},"364":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Usa Fastlane\" description=\"Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio con un script.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane\" />"},"365":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control"},"366":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","content":"Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP."},"367":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Conceptos esenciales"},"368":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control#dos-sistemas-de-decisión","content":"Dos sistemas de decisión"},"369":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Servicios HTTP integrados o externos"},"370":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/access-control#servicios-desa