"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Distribución de confianza"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"Opera el inventario de DMS"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Integra los dispositivos"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"Un &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** actúa como autoridad de registro frente a una flota. Recibe solicitudes, aplica la política de autenticación y encarga la emisión a la CA configurada."},"1014":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"Cada DMS es un límite operativo independiente: puede representar una línea de producto, un entorno o un tipo de dispositivo con su propia CA, reglas de autenticación, confianza distribuida y ventana de renovación."},"1015":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Crea o importa al menos una CA activa."},"1016":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Decide cómo se autenticarán los dispositivos durante el primer enrolamiento."},"1017":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Define qué autoridades debe recibir el dispositivo como anclas de confianza."},"1018":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Asegúrate de tener permisos para administrar DMS."},"1019":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#identifica-la-flota","content":"Asigna al DMS un nombre que describa su alcance, por ejemplo una familia de dispositivos o un entorno."},"1020":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Elige la autoridad que emitirá las identidades. Su política y periodo de validez condicionan los certificados que podrá obtener la flota."},"1021":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#configura-est","content":"Define la autenticación de `enroll`, la política de `reenroll`, la ventana de renovación y, si se necesita, `serverkeygen`."},"1022":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Configura **CA Distribution** para controlar la respuesta del endpoint `cacerts`."},"1023":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Desde el menú del DMS, abre &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** y comprueba la URL base y los ejemplos de invocación antes de integrar el firmware."},"1024":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Lamassu System CA** distribuye el certificado TLS del servidor Lamassu, útil para *pinning*. No representa una CA de emisión."},"1025":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Enrollment CA** añade la autoridad configurada para emitir las identidades del DMS."},"1026":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Managed CAs** permite incluir autoridades adicionales que el dispositivo debe considerar de confianza."},"1027":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Edit** modifica la política del DMS."},"1028":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Go to DMS owned devices** abre únicamente los dispositivos de esa flota."},"1029":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Show/Edit Metadata** permite